# LF everywhere, on every platform: `.prettierrc` pins `endOfLine` to `lf`, and
# a Windows CRLF checkout fails `prettier --check` on every text file. The
# binary rules below come later, and the last matching line wins, so they are
# never rewritten.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Compiled addons and images carry bytes that a line-ending rewrite corrupts.
*.node binary
*.png  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
